# Keep shell/python scripts LF even when checked out on Windows (runner
# `core.autocrlf=true`). A CRLF `scripts/gzip-embed-assets.sh` run under git-bash
# would break its path handling and silently skip gzipping on the Windows release
# legs — so the embedded web UI must stay LF for a correct build everywhere.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
